t then they  kind of changed their mind and said they  might have heard differently we'll have  to wait and see on that although it does  make sense considering that ant-man 3 is  going to focus on the quantum realm and  kang who originally is nathaniel  richards is a descendant of reed  richards or depending on the comic  storyline you follow could also be a  descendant of doctor doom himself now  doom coming sooner than we think  actually doesn't strike me as that odd  because he might even be connected to  wakanda forever at the end of the first  black panther film t'challa said that  they're going to make their resources  available to the world with of course  their biggest resource being vibranium  and if we know good old victor von doom  he's gonna want some of that vibranium  and we do know that neymar is going to  be in wakanda forever and that he'll be  going up against wakanda however this  kind of might be like a batman vs  superman situation where they fight each  other but then ultimately there's a  bigger villain that they have to band  together to fight now wakanda and  atlantis and the comics don't like each  other that's known so it could just play  out as an all-out war however namor  still is a hero in the comics and will  most likely be a hero in the mcu after  all he is a part of the illuminati in  the comics if there was going to be a  greater villain of this movie i would  really hope that they would tease doctor  doom and that could actually be the  start of setting up the fantastic four  plus not to mention dr doom has some  major connections to wanda and wundigor  mountain which we just saw in multiverse  of madness doom is also very connected  to doctor strange as well in fact one of  the story lines that i would absolutely  love to see in the mcu is doom and  doctor strange going to the hell  dimension to try and defeat mephisto to  get doctor doom's mother back so many  connections here plus that insider  account my time to shine hello s